      "side": 1,
      "message": "Indeed, actually it was me who moved it in patchset 5. But there was a reason for that: since Chuanxiao\u0027s original version made `pkvm_get_iommu_domain_noref()` a private function, I renamed it to `__pkvm_get_iommu_domain_noref()` and moved it between `__pkvm_get_iommu_domain_locked()` and `pkvm_get_iommu_domain()`, so that both private functions (\"locked\" and \"noref\") are kept close together, before the public functions.\n\nNow that \"noref\" is public again, there is no reason to move it anymore.",
